{
  "display": "form",
  "name": "seededInputForm",
  "title": "Seeded input fields",
  "type": "form",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "content",
      "key": "uitleg",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "html": "<h3>Putting zaak and taak data into editable fields</h3><p>Every field below is a normal Form.io input &mdash; a textfield or a textarea &mdash; that ZAC has filled in from the zaak or the taak. Add <code>ZAC_INVOER: \"true\"</code> to a <code>ZAC_zaak_gegevens</code> or <code>ZAC_taak_gegevens</code> field and the value is seeded into the field you declared instead of being rendered as read-only text. The same <code>ZAC_VELD</code> paths and <code>ZAC_FORMAAT</code> functions apply.</p><p>Use a format only where the value is read as text. An input that parses its value &mdash; a date picker &mdash; needs the raw value, so leave <code>ZAC_FORMAAT</code> off and let the picker do the formatting. Each field's description shows the declaration that filled it. Change a value, press <em>Save</em>, then reopen the task: your answer is kept and not seeded over.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "title": "Seeded from the zaak",
      "key": "seeded_from_zaak",
      "input": false,
      "tableView": false,
      "components": [
        {
          "label": "Zaaknummer (editable)",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakIdentificatie",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: identificatie",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "identificatie",
            "ZAC_INVOER": "true"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Omschrijving",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakOmschrijving",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: omschrijving",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "omschrijving",
            "ZAC_INVOER": "true"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Startdatum as text (datum format)",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakStartdatum",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: startdatum · ZAC_FORMAAT: datum — a textfield, so the formatted text is fine here",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "startdatum",
            "ZAC_INVOER": "true",
            "ZAC_FORMAAT": "datum"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Startdatum in a date picker",
          "type": "datetime",
          "key": "IN_zaakStartdatumPicker",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: startdatum · no ZAC_FORMAAT — a picker needs the raw ISO value and formats it itself",
          "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
          "enableTime": false,
          "datePicker": {
            "disableWeekends": false,
            "disableWeekdays": false
          },
          "widget": {
            "type": "calendar",
            "displayInTimezone": "viewer",
            "locale": "nl",
            "useLocaleSettings": false,
            "allowInput": true,
            "mode": "single",
            "enableTime": false,
            "noCalendar": false,
            "format": "dd-MM-yyyy",
            "hourIncrement": 1,
            "minuteIncrement": 1,
            "time_24hr": true
          },
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "startdatum",
            "ZAC_INVOER": "true"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Opgeschort as a word",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakOpgeschort",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: isOpgeschort · ZAC_FORMAAT: jaNee",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "isOpgeschort",
            "ZAC_INVOER": "true",
            "ZAC_FORMAAT": "jaNee"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Toelichting, multi-line",
          "type": "textarea",
          "key": "IN_zaakToelichting",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: toelichting",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "toelichting",
            "ZAC_INVOER": "true"
          },
          "rows": 3
        },
        {
          "label": "Zaaktype omschrijving",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakZaaktype",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: zaaktype.omschrijving",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "zaaktype.omschrijving",
            "ZAC_INVOER": "true"
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "Indicaties, joined list",
          "type": "textfield",
          "key": "IN_zaakIndicaties",
          "input": true,
          "tableView": false,
          "description": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens · ZAC_VELD: indicaties",
          "attributes": {
            "ZAC_TYPE": "ZAC_zaak_gegevens"
          },
          "properties": {
            "ZAC_VELD": "indicaties",
            "ZAC_INVOER": "true"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
